    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "The length of a rectangle is $69\\text{ cm}$. The ratio of the length to the width is $3:5$. Find the perimeter of the rectangle.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$368\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "The length represents 3 parts.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{One part}&=69\\div3=23\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Width}&=5\\times23=115\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Perimeter}&=2\\times(69+115)\\\\\\text{Perimeter}&=368\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
